    {
      "chunk_type": "opening",
      "arabic_text": "وَعَلَيْكُمْ بِكِتَابِ اللَّهِ فَإِنَّهُ حَبْلُ اللَّهِ الْمَتِينُ وَهُوَ الصِّرَاطُ الْمُبِينُ وَهُوَ الذِّكْرُ الْحَكِيمُ وَهُوَ الْقُرْآنُ الْعَظِيمُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And hold fast to the Book of Allah, for it is the firm rope of Allah, the clear path, the wise remembrance, and the great Qur'an."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَعَلَيْكُمْ بِسُنَّةِ رَسُولِهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ فَتَمَسَّكُوا بِهَا فَإِنَّهَا سُنَّةُ اللَّهِ الْمَأْمُورُ بِاتِّبَاعِهَا",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And hold fast to the Sunnah of His Messenger (peace be upon him and his family), for it is the Sunnah of Allah which is commanded to be followed."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَعَلَيْكُمْ بِأَهْلِ بَيْتِ نُبُوَّتِهِ فَإِنَّهُمْ عِلْمُ اللَّهِ وَحِكْمَتُهُ وَوَصِيُّهُ فِي خَلْقِهِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And hold fast to the Ahl al-Bayt of his prophethood, for they are the knowledge of Allah, His wisdom, and His testamentary trustees among His creation."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَعَلَيْكُمْ بِالصَّبْرِ عَلَى مَا يُصِيبُكُمْ فِيهِمْ فَإِنَّ الصَّبْرَ مِفْتَاحُ الْفَرَجِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And hold fast to patience for what befalls you because of them, for patience is the key to relief."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَعَلَيْكُمْ بِالدُّعَاءِ فَإِنَّهُ عِبَادَةُ اللَّهِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And hold fast to supplication, for it is the worship of Allah."
